# LumiFota OTA staging (de.lumi.fota)
#
# The app stages packages in /data/ota_package/lumi (labeled ota_package_file so
# uncrypt may read them) and lets RecoverySystem/uncrypt set up the BCB. Nothing
# here changes /cache/recovery permissions: the stock 0770 system:cache is what
# the app relies on (ACCESS_CACHE_FILESYSTEM -> gid cache).

on post-fs-data
    mkdir /data/ota_package 0770 system cache

    # One-shot safety net: drop any leftover staging automation so a reboot can
    # never re-trigger an already processed update.
    rm -f /cache/recovery/command
    rm -f /cache/recovery/openrecoveryscript
